t specific variable, while the numbers in the bottom row give statistics for the multiple regression models. Dashes indicate variables excluded from the final best models because they had a partial regression <italic>p </italic>&#x0003e; 0.1.</p></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></sec></back></article>